{"unit_id":"dundunhan__dsh-video-lens#card-zh","repo":"dundunhan/dsh-video-lens","commit":"9ef313c3a0a7e9786f9464cfc23b675ac1dfb8f9","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:68-108","src/index.js:111-257","src/index.js:260-465","src/frames.js:32-54","src/ask.js:23-117"],"text":"**dsh-video-lens**（DSH 插件，支持挂载该工具集的客户端）：它向 DSH 工具注册表加入视频探查、内容分析和定时点问答工具。探查工具读取本地视频的容器、时长、分辨率、帧率、编解码器、音轨和字幕信息；分析工具按场景变化抽取帧，调用视觉模型生成时间线、画面文字和摘要，并可选合并语音转录；问答工具可按提问中的时间点或转录关键词定位片段，再返回带时间戳和置信度的回答。适合需要让文本模型检视本地视频、查找某段内容或了解视频所说内容的用户。需要配置视觉服务密钥；ASR 密钥可选，并需本机提供 ffmpeg/ffprobe。"}
{"unit_id":"dundunhan__dsh-video-lens#card-en","repo":"dundunhan/dsh-video-lens","commit":"9ef313c3a0a7e9786f9464cfc23b675ac1dfb8f9","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:68-108","src/index.js:111-257","src/index.js:260-465","src/frames.js:32-54","src/ask.js:23-117"],"text":"**dsh-video-lens** (DSH plugin) adds tools to inspect local video metadata, analyze sampled frames with a vision model, optionally add speech transcription, and answer questions about a time or transcript-matched segment with timestamps. Requires a vision API key and ffmpeg/ffprobe; ASR is optional."}
