{"unit_id":"dundunhan__dsh-video-lens#feature-probe","repo":"dundunhan/dsh-video-lens","commit":"9ef313c3a0a7e9786f9464cfc23b675ac1dfb8f9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:68-108","src/probe.js:43-98"],"text":"**dsh-video-lens** 的功能「视频元数据探查」：调用 `video_probe` 检查给定本地视频，返回容器、时长、画面尺寸、帧率、音视频编码、音轨和字幕信息。"}
{"unit_id":"dundunhan__dsh-video-lens#feature-analysis","repo":"dundunhan/dsh-video-lens","commit":"9ef313c3a0a7e9786f9464cfc23b675ac1dfb8f9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:111-257","src/frames.js:32-54","src/vlm.js:159-201"],"text":"**dsh-video-lens** 的功能「场景感知视频分析」：调用 `video_analyze` 检测场景变化并抽取代表帧，交给视觉模型生成摘要、时间线和画面文字；有配置时还会合并语音转录。"}
{"unit_id":"dundunhan__dsh-video-lens#feature-ask","repo":"dundunhan/dsh-video-lens","commit":"9ef313c3a0a7e9786f9464cfc23b675ac1dfb8f9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:260-453","src/ask.js:23-32","src/ask.js:46-107"],"text":"**dsh-video-lens** 的功能「按时间或内容提问」：调用 `video_ask` 解析明确时间或匹配转录关键词，重新抽取相关片段的画面，并返回回答、支持时间戳与置信度。"}
{"unit_id":"dundunhan__dsh-video-lens#caveat-keys","repo":"dundunhan/dsh-video-lens","commit":"9ef313c3a0a7e9786f9464cfc23b675ac1dfb8f9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:34-42","src/index.js:153-159","src/asr.js:36-55","src/vlm.js:51-64"],"text":"dsh-video-lens 使用视觉分析时需提供 `VIDEO_LENS_API_KEY`；视频画面会发送到配置的视觉服务。ASR 密钥 `VIDEO_LENS_ASR_KEY` 为可选，启用后音频也会发送到相应服务。"}
{"unit_id":"dundunhan__dsh-video-lens#caveat-local","repo":"dundunhan/dsh-video-lens","commit":"9ef313c3a0a7e9786f9464cfc23b675ac1dfb8f9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/probe.js:43-58","src/frames.js:130-148","src/frames.js:165-189"],"text":"dsh-video-lens 依赖本机 PATH 中的 `ffprobe` 和 `ffmpeg` 处理视频，并在系统临时目录生成帧文件；处理结束后会清理临时目录。"}
